Package: scAnnoX
Title: An R Package Integrating Multiple Public Tools for Single-Cell Annotation.
Version: 1.0.0
Date: 2024-01-06
Authors: person("Xiaoqian", "Huang", "h_xiaoq@163.com", role = c("aut"))
Maintainer: Xiaoqian Huang <h_xiaoq@163.com>
Description: scAnnoX is an R package that integrates 10 different cell identity algorithms for single-cell sequencing data into a unified framework, and allows comparison between different algorithms.
